ity</b>", "docsize": 30356, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Rajasthan High Court - Jaipur", "author": "S Jain", "authorEncoded": "s-jain"}, {"tid": 90684459, "catids": [175, 268, 10], "doctype": 1022, "publishdate": "2022-10-17", "authorid": 1540, "bench": [1540], "title": "Sanjeev Kumar vs The State Of Bihar Through Its The ... on 17 October, 2022", "numcites": 24, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "would amount to acquittal. Sub-<b>section</b> (4) of\n\n         <b>Section</b> <b>152</b> clearly stipulates the disability clause and provides\n\n         that <b>compounding</b> of offences would be available ... absence of\n\n         <b>compounding</b> fee being paid as contemplated under <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>\n\n         the offences cannot be <b>compounded</b>.  \n \n                        The Hon&#x27;ble Division Bench concurred with", "docsize": 29347, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Patna High Court", "author": "R R Prasad", "authorEncoded": "r-r-prasad"}, {"tid": 40249998, "catids": [4], "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2014-12-01", "authorid": 197, "bench": [197, 298], "title": "Hari Nandan vs State Of U.P. And 2 Ors. on 1 December, 2014", "numcites": 20, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "respondents submits that <b>compounding</b> for offence under  <b>section</b> <b>152</b> (1)  is permitted under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>(4)  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act. It  only once ... provided under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>(4)  which read thus:\t\n  \n \t\t&quot;<b>152</b>. <b>Compounding</b> of offences.- \n  \n \t\t(4)\tThe <b>compounding</b> of an offence under sub-<b>section</b> (1) \tshall", "docsize": 23513, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "R Tiwari", "authorEncoded": "r-tiwari"}, {"tid": 157614549, "catids": null, "doctype": 1003, "publishdate": "2022-03-04", "authorid": 634, "bench": [634], "title": "Nibha & Ors vs State Of Nct Of Delhi & Anr on 4 March, 2022", "numcites": 15, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "2020 Police Station